            <ArticleTitle>Sclerosing stromal tumour of the ovary.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>92-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Sclerosing stromal tumour (SST) of the ovary is a rare entity. It is a benign neoplasm which forms a distinct subgroup separate from the other ovarian stromal tumours, including thecomafibromas, by virtue of its unique histology. One such tumour in a 25-year old female is reported.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
